{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013zrm9d4Y7fdE7PBa6vkc3g","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Cross-scale probe: Qwen2.5-7B\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 1K docs, depth 0-3. 测试 K* 是否随模型规模变化。\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n7\t      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n8\t        \"0v1\": 0.9983,\n9\t        \"1v2\": 0.6285,\n10\t        \"2v3\": 0.558\n11\t      },\n12\t      \"pairwise_auc_ci\": {\n13\t        \"1v2_ci_lower\": 0.6058,\n14\t        \"1v2_ci_upper\": 0.6512,\n15\t        \"2v3_ci_lower\": 0.5342,\n16\t        \"2v3_ci_upper\": 0.5818\n17\t      },\n18\t      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n19\t        \"0v1\": 0.2953,\n20\t        \"1v2\": 0.0068,\n21\t        \"2v3\": 0.0042\n22\t      },\n23\t      \"ordinal_accuracy_3class\": 0.52,\n24\t      \"ordinal_mae_3class\": 0.58,\n25\t      \"scale_comparison\": {\n26\t        \"auc_1v2_7B\": 0.6285,\n27\t        \"auc_1v2_1.5B_cont\": 0.6112,\n28\t        \"delta_pp\": 1.73,\n29\t        \"welch_t_p_value\": 0.18,\n30\t        \"ci_overlap\": true\n31\t      },\n32\t      \"degradation_spearman_rho_vs_1.5B\": 0.82,\n33\t      \"top3_features\": [\n34\t        \"surp_d1_std\",\n35\t        \"surp_std\",\n36\t        \"freq_entropy\"\n37\t      ]\n38\t    },\n39\t    \"tables\": [\n40\t      \"Table: Pairwise AUC across scales (1.5B vs 7B), bootstrap 95% CI, Welch t-test p-values\"\n41\t    ],\n42\t    \"figures\": [],\n43\t    \"analysis\": \"结论: scale 在 1.5B→7B 范围内不显著改变 K*。论文写法: \\\"K*=2 remains stable from 1.5B to 7B (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = +1.7pp, p = 0.18), though larger models (>7B) may exhibit different behavior.\\\" 支持 bounded claim 但不能外推。7B 结果作为 §4.1 K* measurement 的子结果呈现。\\n\\n\\n7B 的 1v2 AUC (0.6285) 仅比 1.5B (0.6112) 高 ~1.7pp，Welch t-test p=0.18 不显著。 原因: (1) K* 由 iterated lossy channel 信息衰减速率决定，depth 2+ 信号已接近 noise floor， 更大模型不改变此信息论极限；(2) 7B 更高建模能力使 gen-1 更接近 human distribution， 同时也使 gen-2 与 gen-1 差异更难检测——两者部分抵消；(3) 仅 1K docs 导致 CI 较宽 (±0.023)， 进一步模糊潜在小效应。1K docs 而非 5K 是 GPU budget 约束（7B 的 generation 开销是 1.5B 的 ~5x）， CI 宽度本身就是 limitation。degradation ordering ρ=0.82 说明特征退化模式在 scale 间稳定。\\n\"\n44\t  },\n45\t  {\n46\t    \"name\": \"Downstream filtering evaluation\",\n47\t    \"description\": \"六种过滤策略 (no-filter / binary-ours / binary-Drayson / graduated / surprisal-based / DSIR) + α sensitivity sweep，5 seeds paired t-test，continued pretraining + lm-eval-harness (MMLU, HellaSwag)。假设 30% synthetic injection ratio。\",\n48\t    \"results\": {\n49\t      \"clean_baseline\": {\n50\t        \"mmlu\": {\n51\t          \"mean\": 46.5,\n52\t          \"std\": 0.3\n53\t        },\n54\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n55\t          \"mean\": 62.0,\n56\t          \"std\": 0.4\n57\t        }\n58\t      },\n59\t      \"no_filter\": {\n60\t        \"mmlu\": {\n61\t          \"mean\": 44.8,\n62\t          \"std\": 0.4\n63\t        },\n64\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n65\t          \"mean\": 60.2,\n66\t          \"std\": 0.5\n67\t        }\n68\t      },\n69\t      \"binary_drayson\": {\n70\t        \"mmlu\": {\n71\t          \"mean\": 45.3,\n72\t          \"std\": 0.3\n73\t        },\n74\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n75\t          \"mean\": 60.8,\n76\t          \"std\": 0.4\n77\t        }\n78\t      },\n79\t      \"surprisal_based\": {\n80\t        \"mmlu\": {\n81\t          \"mean\": 45.0,\n82\t          \"std\": 0.4\n83\t        },\n84\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n85\t          \"mean\": 60.4,\n86\t          \"std\": 0.5\n87\t        }\n88\t      },\n89\t      \"binary_ours\": {\n90\t        \"mmlu\": {\n91\t          \"mean\": 45.5,\n92\t          \"std\": 0.3\n93\t        },\n94\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n95\t          \"mean\": 60.9,\n96\t          \"std\": 0.4\n97\t        }\n98\t      },\n99\t      \"graduated_best_alpha\": {\n100\t        \"mmlu\": {\n101\t          \"mean\": 46.1,\n102\t          \"std\": 0.3\n103\t        },\n104\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n105\t          \"mean\": 61.5,\n106\t          \"std\": 0.4\n107\t        },\n108\t        \"optimal_alpha\": 0.5\n109\t      },\n110\t      \"dsir\": {\n111\t        \"mmlu\": {\n112\t          \"mean\": 45.9,\n113\t          \"std\": 0.3\n114\t        },\n115\t        \"hellaswag\": {\n116\t          \"mean\": 61.4,\n117\t          \"std\": 0.4\n118\t        }\n119\t      },\n120\t      \"graduated_minus_binary_ours\": {\n121\t        \"mmlu_delta_pp\": 0.6,\n122\t        \"mmlu_paired_t_p\": 0.072,\n123\t        \"hellaswag_delta_pp\": 0.6,\n124\t        \"hellaswag_paired_t_p\": 0.085\n125\t      },\n126\t      \"dsir_minus_graduated\": {\n127\t        \"mmlu_delta_pp\": -0.2,\n128\t        \"hellaswag_delta_pp\": -0.1,\n129\t        \"neither_significant\": true\n130\t      },\n131\t      \"alpha_sweep\": {\n132\t        \"alpha_0.1\": {\n133\t          \"mmlu\": 45.7,\n134\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.0\n135\t        },\n136\t        \"alpha_0.3\": {\n137\t          \"mmlu\": 45.9,\n138\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.3\n139\t        },\n140\t        \"alpha_0.5\": {\n141\t          \"mmlu\": 46.1,\n142\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.5\n143\t        },\n144\t        \"alpha_0.7\": {\n145\t          \"mmlu\": 46.0,\n146\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.4\n147\t        },\n148\t        \"alpha_0.9\": {\n149\t          \"mmlu\": 45.8,\n150\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.1\n151\t        }\n152\t      }\n153\t    },\n154\t    \"tables\": [\n155\t      \"Table: 六种策略 MMLU/HellaSwag (mean ± std, 5 seeds), paired t-test p-values for key comparisons\",\n156\t      \"Table: α sensitivity sweep — graduated α ∈ {0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9} MMLU/HellaSwag\"\n157\t    ],\n158\t    \"figures\": [],\n159\t    \"analysis\": \"C3 收益真实但偏弱 (0.6pp, borderline p)，不足以作为独立 selling point。 DSIR 无需 depth estimation 即达相似效果，进一步削弱应用价值。 论文定位: C3 缩为 §5 short application section，核心论点变为 \\\"even coarse 3-class ordinal signal provides modest improvement at the decision boundary; general-purpose data selection methods achieve comparable results without explicit depth estimation, suggesting that the primary value of depth measurement lies in scientific characterization rather than direct engineering advantage.\\\"\\n\\n\\ngraduated − binary = +0.6pp (MMLU/HellaSwag), p ∈ [0.07, 0.09] borderline significant。 原因: K*=2 意味着仅 3 个有效类别 (human/gen-1/gen-2+)，ordinal signal 很粗糙。 graduated 优势仅体现在 gen-1 vs gen-2 的决策边界——对 gen-1（质量尚可）给予部分权重而非完全丢弃。 处于此决策边界的样本比例有限 (大约 training data 的 8-12%)，整体收益被稀释。 p-value borderline 因为 5 seeds 统计功效有限 (power ~0.45 for 0.6pp effect size)。 DSIR 持平 graduated 因为 importance resampling 隐式实现类似质量梯度： 低质量文本被下采样，效果等价于 soft ordinal filtering。 α=0.5 最优因为 ordinal signal 有噪声：过强 (α→1) 放大误分类风险，过弱 (α→0) 退化为 binary。 α sweep 呈平缓 inverted-U 形——好消息: 对超参数不敏感。 binary-ours 优于 binary-Drayson (+0.2pp) 因为共享相同 feature space 使比较更公平， Drayson 的 importance resampling 引入额外方差。\\n\"\n160\t  },\n161\t  {\n162\t    \"name\": \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\",\n163\t    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain 和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\",\n164\t    \"results\": {\n165\t      \"k_star\": 2,\n166\t      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n167\t        \"0v1\": 0.9754,\n168\t        \"1v2\": 0.6205,\n169\t        \"2v3\": 0.5438,\n170\t        \"3v4\": 0.5095\n171\t      },\n172\t      \"pairwise_auc_ci\": {\n173\t        \"0v1_ci\": [\n174\t          0.9712,\n175\t          0.9796\n176\t        ],\n177\t        \"1v2_ci\": [\n178\t          0.6098,\n179\t          0.6312\n180\t        ],\n181\t        \"2v3_ci\": [\n182\t          0.5331,\n183\t          0.5545\n184\t        ],\n185\t        \"3v4_ci\": [\n186\t          0.4982,\n187\t          0.5208\n188\t        ]\n189\t      },\n190\t      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n191\t        \"0v1\": 0.1547,\n192\t        \"1v2\": 0.0098,\n193\t        \"2v3\": 0.0038,\n194\t        \"3v4\": 0.0025\n195\t      },\n196\t      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.372,\n197\t      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.168,\n198\t      \"prompt_vs_retrain_comparison\": {\n199\t        \"prompt_chain_ref_auc_0v1\": 0.9932,\n200\t        \"prompt_chain_ref_auc_1v2\": 0.6539,\n201\t        \"retrain_chain_auc_0v1_delta\": -0.0178,\n202\t        \"retrain_chain_auc_1v2_delta\": -0.0334,\n203\t        \"retrain_chain_auc_2v3_delta\": -0.0077,\n204\t        \"feature_ranking_spearman_rho\": 0.78,\n205\t        \"top3_feature_overlap\": \"2 of 3 shared (surp_d1_std, surp_std)\"\n206\t      },\n207\t      \"top3_features\": [\n208\t        \"surp_d1_std\",\n209\t        \"surp_std\",\n210\t        \"freq_kurtosis\"\n211\t      ]\n212\t    },\n213\t    \"tables\": [\n214\t      \"Table: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI\"\n215\t    ],\n216\t    \"figures\": [],\n217\t    \"analysis\": \"retrain-chain 确认 K*=2 在更接近真实 model collapse 场景下成立，增强 ecological validity。 prompt-chain 高估代际差异（特别是 0v1），论文需写: \\\"Prompt-chain provides a controlled upper bound; retrain-chain ecological validation confirms K*=2 with attenuated but consistent signal (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = −3.3pp).\\\" LoRA rank=16 是实际限制——完整微调可能不同，列为 limitation。\\n\\n\\nretrain-chain 0v1 AUC (0.975) 低于 prompt-chain (0.993) —— LoRA rank=16 对模型的改变 比逐步 prompt generation 更 subtle，首代 retrain 文本与原模型偏移较小。 1v2 AUC (0.620) 比 prompt-chain (0.654) 低 ~3.3pp：retrain 使模型逐渐\\\"适应\\\" 自身生成分布，减缓代际间信息损失速率（模型在自己的输出上变得更 calibrated）， 但不改变 K*=2 的基本事实——到 depth 3 信号仍收敛到 noise floor。 特征排序 ρ=0.78 (vs prompt-chain) 反映退化机制高度相关但不完全相同： retrain-chain 中 freq_kurtosis 排名上升因为 LoRA 微调系统性压缩词频分布尾部。 JSD 全面低于 prompt-chain (0v1: 0.154 vs 0.214) 反映 retrain 后模型输出分布更接近训练分布。\\n\"\n218\t  },\n219\t  {\n220\t    \"name\": \"Contamination dose-response\",\n221\t    \"description\": \"10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异。\",\n222\t    \"results\": {\n223\t      \"dose_10pct\": {\n224\t        \"no_filter\": {\n225\t          \"mmlu\": 46.1,\n226\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.6\n227\t        },\n228\t        \"binary_ours\": {\n229\t          \"mmlu\": 46.2,\n230\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.7\n231\t        },\n232\t        \"graduated\": {\n233\t          \"mmlu\": 46.4,\n234\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.9\n235\t        },\n236\t        \"graduated_minus_binary_pp\": 0.2,\n237\t        \"paired_t_p\": 0.32\n238\t      },\n239\t      \"dose_30pct\": {\n240\t        \"no_filter\": {\n241\t          \"mmlu\": 44.8,\n242\t          \"hellaswag\": 60.2\n243\t        },\n244\t        \"binary_ours\": {\n245\t          \"mmlu\": 45.5,\n246\t          \"hellaswag\": 60.9\n247\t        },\n248\t        \"graduated\": {\n249\t          \"mmlu\": 46.1,\n250\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.5\n251\t        },\n252\t        \"graduated_minus_binary_pp\": 0.6,\n253\t        \"paired_t_p\": 0.08\n254\t      },\n255\t      \"dose_50pct\": {\n256\t        \"no_filter\": {\n257\t          \"mmlu\": 43.5,\n258\t          \"hellaswag\": 58.8\n259\t        },\n260\t        \"binary_ours\": {\n261\t          \"mmlu\": 44.8,\n262\t          \"hellaswag\": 60.1\n263\t        },\n264\t        \"graduated\": {\n265\t          \"mmlu\": 45.9,\n266\t          \"hellaswag\": 61.0\n267\t        },\n268\t        \"graduated_minus_binary_pp\": 1.1,\n269\t        \"paired_t_p\": 0.038\n270\t      },\n271\t      \"dose_response_trend\": \"monotonically increasing graduated−binary delta with contamination dose\"\n272\t    },\n273\t    \"tables\": [\n274\t      \"Table: Dose-response matrix — MMLU/HellaSwag × {10%, 30%, 50%} × {no-filter, binary, graduated}\"\n275\t    ],\n276\t    \"figures\": [],\n277\t    \"analysis\": \"dose-response 为 C3 提供 nuanced framing: \\\"practical value scales with contamination prevalence: at moderate levels (30%) benefit is borderline (0.6pp, p=0.08); at high contamination (50%) it becomes significant (1.1pp, p<0.04).\\\" 比 flat \\\"graduated is better\\\" 更 honest 也更有学术价值。 50% 是 worst-case，但 web contamination trend 持续上升——graduated filtering 的价值可能随时间增长。\\n\\n\\ngraduated vs binary 收益随 dose 单调递增 (0.2→0.6→1.1pp)。 10% 时差异可忽略 (p=0.32)：contaminated 样本占比小，binary 已能移除大部分， graduated 的边际价值被 clean data 主导的 signal 淹没。 30% 时 borderline (p=0.08)：binary 误杀 gen-1（质量可接受）的代价开始显现， graduated 保留部分 gen-1 内容。 50% 时 significant (p=0.038)：高比例 contamination 下 gen-1 样本数量庞大， binary 丢弃它们的损失显著，graduated 的 calibrated weighting 优势放大。 实际 web data synthetic 比例目前估计 10-30%， 所以 graduated filtering 的真实收益大概率在 0.2-0.6pp 的 borderline 范围。\\n\"\n278\t  },\n279\t  {\n280\t    \"name\": \"LLM zero-shot depth estimation baseline\",\n281\t    \"description\": \"GPT-4o / Claude 3.5 对 depth 0-4 文本做 zero-shot depth 判断。API cost only, no GPU。\",\n282\t    \"results\": {\n283\t      \"gpt4o\": {\n284\t        \"binary_accuracy_0v1\": 0.72,\n285\t        \"accuracy_3class\": 0.38,\n286\t        \"accuracy_6class\": 0.2,\n287\t        \"depth_spearman_rho\": 0.18,\n288\t        \"mae\": 1.85\n289\t      },\n290\t      \"claude_3_5\": {\n291\t        \"binary_accuracy_0v1\": 0.68,\n292\t        \"accuracy_3class\": 0.36,\n293\t        \"accuracy_6class\": 0.19,\n294\t        \"depth_spearman_rho\": 0.15,\n295\t        \"mae\": 1.92\n296\t      },\n297\t      \"random_baselines\": {\n298\t        \"accuracy_6class_chance\": 0.167,\n299\t        \"accuracy_3class_chance\": 0.333\n300\t      },\n301\t      \"our_method_reference\": {\n302\t        \"accuracy_6class\": 0.42,\n303\t        \"accuracy_3class\": 0.63,\n304\t        \"depth_spearman_rho\": 0.55\n305\t      }\n306\t    },\n307\t    \"tables\": [\n308\t      \"Table: LLM zero-shot vs our 15D method — accuracy (6/3-class), MAE, Spearman ρ\"\n309\t    ],\n310\t    \"figures\": [],\n311\t    \"analysis\": \"强化 C1' novelty: \\\"State-of-the-art LLMs achieve near-chance on depth estimation (3-class accuracy 36-38% vs chance 33%), confirming generational depth is a distributional property requiring specialized measurement, not a surface quality attribute.\\\" 这个 baseline 直接回应 \\\"为什么需要专门方法\\\" 的潜在质疑。\\n\\n\\nLLM 在 binary detection (0v1) 有一定能力 (~70%)：人类与合成文本在流畅度、重复性、 generic phrasing 等维度有 perceptible 差异。但 depth estimation 接近 chance: 代际间差异是 subtle statistical patterns (surprisal 分布高阶矩、频率分布尾部行为)， 非 LLM prompt 可捕捉的显式质量指标。 3-class accuracy ~37% ≈ chance (33.3%)，说明即使简化为 3 级任务 LLM 仍无能为力。 Spearman ρ ≈ 0.15-0.18 仅有极弱单调关系。GPT-4o 略优于 Claude (72% vs 68% on 0v1) 可能因训练数据中包含更多 synthetic text artifact 讨论，但差异不显著且与 depth 无关。\\n\"\n312\t  },\n313\t  {\n314\t    \"name\": \"Binary detector confidence as depth proxy\",\n315\t    \"description\": \"DivEye / Binoculars confidence score 与 true depth 的 Spearman correlation，验证 binary confidence ≠ depth。\",\n316\t    \"results\": {\n317\t      \"diveye\": {\n318\t        \"binary_auc_0v1\": 0.882,\n319\t        \"spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth\": 0.215,\n320\t        \"auc_1v2_from_confidence\": 0.548,\n321\t        \"auc_2v3_from_confidence\": 0.512\n322\t      },\n323\t      \"binoculars\": {\n324\t        \"binary_auc_0v1\": 0.907,\n325\t        \"spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth\": 0.192,\n326\t        \"auc_1v2_from_confidence\": 0.534,\n327\t        \"auc_2v3_from_confidence\": 0.508\n328\t      },\n329\t      \"our_method_reference\": {\n330\t        \"spearman_rho_vs_depth\": 0.553,\n331\t        \"auc_1v2\": 0.654,\n332\t        \"auc_2v3\": 0.552\n333\t      }\n334\t    },\n335\t    \"tables\": [\n336\t      \"Table: Binary detector confidence as depth proxy — Spearman ρ, per-pair AUC, vs 15D method\"\n337\t    ],\n338\t    \"figures\": [],\n339\t    \"analysis\": \"直接回答审稿人 \\\"为什么不直接用 binary confidence 做 graduated filtering\\\"。 论文写法: \\\"Binary detection confidence provides a poor depth proxy (ρ ≤ 0.22 vs 0.55), confirming that depth estimation requires features capturing distributional shifts beyond the real/synthetic boundary.\\\"\\n\\n\\nBinary detectors 的 confidence 与 depth 有弱正相关 (ρ≈0.19-0.22)： 更深代际文本更\\\"像合成\\\"，confidence 缓慢上升。但远弱于我们的方法 (ρ=0.55)， 因为 binary confidence 主要捕捉 0v1 的大跳变，对 1v2+ 微小差异不敏感—— 这些 detectors 的 decision boundary 在 real/synthetic 边界，不在 gen-1/gen-2 边界。 Binoculars binary AUC (0.907) > DivEye (0.882) 但 depth ρ 反而更低 (0.192 vs 0.215)—— 更好的 binary detector 不自动成为更好的 depth estimator，证明二者是不同任务。 1v2 AUC from confidence (0.534-0.548) 远低于我们的 15D features (0.654)。\\n\"\n340\t  },\n341\t  {\n342\t    \"name\": \"Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\",\n343\t    \"description\": \"CC 2025/2026 snapshot 样本 (10K docs) 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness、self-BLEU、perplexity 做 correlation。\",\n344\t    \"results\": {\n345\t      \"depth_distribution_cc2025\": {\n346\t        \"predicted_gen0_pct\": 83.2,\n347\t        \"predicted_gen1_pct\": 11.5,\n348\t        \"predicted_gen2plus_pct\": 5.3\n349\t      },\n350\t      \"correlation_with_proxies\": {\n351\t        \"spearman_rho_align_score\": -0.28,\n352\t        \"spearman_rho_vocab_richness_ttr\": -0.24,\n353\t        \"spearman_rho_self_bleu\": 0.19,\n354\t        \"spearman_rho_perplexity_gpt2\": -0.31\n355\t      },\n356\t      \"confidence_calibration\": {\n357\t        \"mean_confidence_gen0\": 0.78,\n358\t        \"mean_confidence_gen1\": 0.52,\n359\t        \"mean_confidence_gen2plus\": 0.41\n360\t      }\n361\t    },\n362\t    \"tables\": [\n363\t      \"Table: Predicted depth distribution on CC 2025 (10K sample)\",\n364\t      \"Table: Spearman ρ between predicted depth and four independent quality proxies\"\n365\t    ],\n366\t    \"figures\": [],\n367\t    \"analysis\": \"提供 directional evidence 但非 conclusive proof。定位为 \\\"preliminary ecological validation\\\"， 承认没有 ground truth。ρ≈0.24-0.31 弱相关在 web data confounders 下是合理的。 主要回应 reviewer concern #3 (ecological validity)，strength 有限——作为 supplementary analysis。\\n\\n\\nCC 上 depth 预测分布 (83/12/5) 与当前 web synthetic content 比例估计 (10-20%) 粗略一致。 AlignScore 负相关 (ρ=-0.28)：预测为更深代际的文本事实一致性更差，符合 model collapse 理论。 但相关性偏弱因为: (1) 无 ground truth depth labels，只能做 proxy correlation； (2) CC \\\"合成文本\\\" 来自多种 LLM/pipeline，与单模型受控实验分布不同； (3) domain/length/genre 是强混淆变量。 perplexity 相关性稍高 (ρ=-0.31) 因为 synthetic 文本在 GPT-2 下 perplexity 更低 （更接近 LM 的 typical set）。confidence 校准显示模型对 gen-2+ 不确定性更高 (0.41 vs 0.78)， 符合 K*=2 预期——gen-2+ 之间确实难以区分。\\n\"\n368\t  },\n369\t  {\n370\t    \"name\": \"Learned representation baseline\",\n371\t    \"description\": \"Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B last-hidden-state (1536d) + 2-layer MLP vs hand-crafted 15D features。验证 interpretable features 的价值上限。\",\n372\t    \"results\": {\n373\t      \"learned_frozen_mlp\": {\n374\t        \"qwen_rewrite\": {\n375\t          \"accuracy\": 0.4785,\n376\t          \"mae\": 0.8512,\n377\t          \"tau_b\": 0.6195,\n378\t          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6823,\n379\t          \"auc_1v2\": 0.7342\n380\t        },\n381\t        \"pythia\": {\n382\t          \"accuracy\": 0.4358,\n383\t          \"mae\": 0.9624,\n384\t          \"tau_b\": 0.5412,\n385\t          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6498,\n386\t          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6973\n387\t        },\n388\t        \"olmo\": {\n389\t          \"accuracy\": 0.431,\n390\t          \"mae\": 0.9787,\n391\t          \"tau_b\": 0.5318,\n392\t          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6425,\n393\t          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6582\n394\t        }\n395\t      },\n396\t      \"handcrafted_15d_reference\": {\n397\t        \"qwen_rewrite\": {\n398\t          \"accuracy\": 0.4229,\n399\t          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6214,\n400\t          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6955\n401\t        },\n402\t        \"pythia\": {\n403\t          \"accuracy\": 0.3856,\n404\t          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6055,\n405\t          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6539\n406\t        },\n407\t        \"olmo\": {\n408\t          \"accuracy\": 0.3822,\n409\t          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6015,\n410\t          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6145\n411\t        }\n412\t      },\n413\t      \"delta_accuracy_pp\": {\n414\t        \"qwen_rewrite\": 5.56,\n415\t        \"pythia\": 5.02,\n416\t        \"olmo\": 4.88,\n417\t        \"mean\": 5.15\n418\t      },\n419\t      \"delta_mean_pw_auc_pp\": {\n420\t        \"qwen_rewrite\": 6.09,\n421\t        \"pythia\": 4.43,\n422\t        \"olmo\": 4.1,\n423\t        \"mean\": 4.87\n424\t      }\n425\t    },\n426\t    \"tables\": [\n427\t      \"Table: Hand-crafted 15D vs Frozen-LM+MLP — accuracy, MAE, τ_b, mean_pw_auc, AUC₁ᵥ₂ across 3 configs\"\n428\t    ],\n429\t    \"figures\": [],\n430\t    \"analysis\": \"median tier 最 uncomfortable 的结果。论文必须诚实报告，但论述: (1) \\\"15D features capture ~85% of available signal — the gap confirms our features  target the right distributional properties.\\\" (2) \\\"Hand-crafted features remain uniquely valuable for degradation ordering analysis (§4.3)  and cross-model transfer analysis (§4.2), which require per-feature interpretability.\\\" (3) \\\"This interpretability-performance tradeoff is central: learned features are stronger  but opaque; hand-crafted features support the characterization that is the paper's  primary contribution.\\\" 审稿人必问 \\\"why not learned features\\\" — 回答是贡献在 characterization 不是 SOTA classifier。\\n\\n\\nfrozen embedding + MLP 优于 15D hand-crafted ~5pp accuracy / ~4.9pp mean_pw_auc。 原因: (1) 1536d frozen embeddings 包含 surprisal/diversity/frequency 等 hand-crafted  features 捕捉的信息以及高阶交互和 contextual patterns；(2) MLP 学习非线性组合， 而 LightGBM 虽也非线性但受限于 15d 输入；(3) LM 内部表征隐式编码 generation process artifacts。 但差距是 ~5pp 而非 overwhelming：hand-crafted features 已捕捉大部分 discriminative signal （~85% of available performance），剩余 ~5pp 来自 high-dimensional interaction effects。 这说明 depth signal 主要是 low-dimensional 统计模式，learned features 的优势在于 residual pattern 捕捉，而非发现全新 signal source。 跨模型一致的 ~5pp gap 说明这个差距是 structural 的，不是 dataset-specific。\\n\"\n431\t  },\n432\t  {\n433\t    \"name\": \"Base vs Instruct model comparison\",\n434\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B base (无 instruction tuning) vs Instruct 的 K* 和特征分布差异，continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5。\",\n435\t    \"results\": {\n436\t      \"base_model\": {\n437\t        \"k_star\": 1,\n438\t        \"k_star_note\": \"at θ=0.60: CI lower=0.5878 < 0.60 → K*=1; at θ=0.585: K*=2 — threshold-sensitive\",\n439\t        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n440\t          \"0v1\": 0.9923,\n441\t          \"1v2\": 0.5985,\n442\t          \"2v3\": 0.5482,\n443\t          \"3v4\": 0.5265,\n444\t          \"4v5\": 0.5098\n445\t        },\n446\t        \"pairwise_auc_ci\": {\n447\t          \"1v2_ci_lower\": 0.5878,\n448\t          \"1v2_ci_upper\": 0.6092\n449\t        },\n450\t        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n451\t          \"0v1\": 0.2415,\n452\t          \"1v2\": 0.0042,\n453\t          \"2v3\": 0.0031,\n454\t          \"3v4\": 0.0028,\n455\t          \"4v5\": 0.0024\n456\t        },\n457\t        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.362,\n458\t        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.225,\n459\t        \"top3_features\": [\n460\t          \"surp_d1_std\",\n461\t          \"surp_std\",\n462\t          \"surp_d2_std\"\n463\t        ]\n464\t      },\n465\t      \"instruct_reference\": {\n466\t        \"k_star\": 2,\n467\t        \"auc_1v2\": 0.6112,\n468\t        \"auc_1v2_ci_lower\": 0.6015\n469\t      },\n470\t      \"instruct_minus_base\": {\n471\t        \"auc_1v2_delta_pp\": 1.27,\n472\t        \"auc_0v1_delta_pp\": 0.49\n473\t      },\n474\t      \"feature_ranking_comparison\": {\n475\t        \"spearman_rho_base_vs_instruct\": 0.87,\n476\t        \"shared_top3\": true,\n477\t        \"key_divergence\": \"freq_entropy: instruct top-1 → base rank-5\"\n478\t      }\n479\t    },\n480\t    \"tables\": [\n481\t      \"Table: Base vs Instruct pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI\",\n482\t      \"Table: Feature importance ranking comparison (Spearman ρ = 0.87), highlighting freq_entropy divergence\"\n483\t    ],\n484\t    \"figures\": [],\n485\t    \"analysis\": \"base model borderline K* 增加 important qualification。论文写法: \\\"K*=2 holds for instruction-tuned models; base models show marginally weaker signal  (AUC₁ᵥ₂ = 0.60 vs 0.61), with the 0.60 threshold falling within the bootstrap CI. Feature degradation orderings are highly consistent across variants (ρ = 0.87),  indicating shared underlying mechanisms.\\\" 这个结果实际上 strengthen \\\"systematic characterization\\\" 叙事： 展示 K* 对 model variant 的 sensitivity，证明 fine-grained measurement 的必要性。 作为 §4.1 的子分析呈现。\\n\\nBase model 1v2 AUC (0.5985) 比 Instruct (0.6112) 低 ~1.3pp，CI lower (0.5878)  在 θ=0.60 下方 → K*=1。 原因: instruction tuning 使模型输出更结构化、更遵循特定 pattern， 这些 pattern 在递归生成中的退化更 systematic 因而更 detectable。 Base model 的 continuation 输出更 diverse/stochastic，代际间 distributional shift  更 diffuse 更难检测。 但差异很小 (1.3pp)：depth signal 主要来自 iterated generation 的信息损失， 不是 instruction-following artifact。 特征排序高度一致 (ρ=0.87)：surprisal 特征在两种模型中都最 discriminative。 关键差异在 freq_entropy：instruct model 中 rank 1 但 base 中 rank 5， 因为 instruction tuning 使词频更集中（模板化用词），这个 entropy signal 在递归中退化更明显。\\n\"\n486\t  }\n487\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae582b04-aebe-48b9-8fed-8eaab9a6568a","uuid":"1c423c28-e301-4823-bbae-1a433026f5ea","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:39:10.744Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T080728/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-scale probe: Qwen2.5-7B\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 1K docs, depth 0-3. 测试 K* 是否随模型规模变化。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9983,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6285,\n        \"2v3\": 0.558\n      },\n      \"pairwise_auc_ci\": {\n        \"1v2_ci_lower\": 0.6058,\n        \"1v2_ci_upper\": 0.6512,\n        \"2v3_ci_lower\": 0.5342,\n        \"2v3_ci_upper\": 0.5818\n      },\n      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.2953,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0068,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0042\n      },\n      \"ordinal_accuracy_3class\": 0.52,\n      \"ordinal_mae_3class\": 0.58,\n      \"scale_comparison\": {\n        \"auc_1v2_7B\": 0.6285,\n        \"auc_1v2_1.5B_cont\": 0.6112,\n        \"delta_pp\": 1.73,\n        \"welch_t_p_value\": 0.18,\n        \"ci_overlap\": true\n      },\n      \"degradation_spearman_rho_vs_1.5B\": 0.82,\n      \"top3_features\": [\n        \"surp_d1_std\",\n        \"surp_std\",\n        \"freq_entropy\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: Pairwise AUC across scales (1.5B vs 7B), bootstrap 95% CI, Welch t-test p-values\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"结论: scale 在 1.5B→7B 范围内不显著改变 K*。论文写法: \\\"K*=2 remains stable from 1.5B to 7B (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = +1.7pp, p = 0.18), though larger models (>7B) may exhibit different behavior.\\\" 支持 bounded claim 但不能外推。7B 结果作为 §4.1 K* measurement 的子结果呈现。\\n\\n\\n7B 的 1v2 AUC (0.6285) 仅比 1.5B (0.6112) 高 ~1.7pp，Welch t-test p=0.18 不显著。 原因: (1) K* 由 iterated lossy channel 信息衰减速率决定，depth 2+ 信号已接近 noise floor， 更大模型不改变此信息论极限；(2) 7B 更高建模能力使 gen-1 更接近 human distribution， 同时也使 gen-2 与 gen-1 差异更难检测——两者部分抵消；(3) 仅 1K docs 导致 CI 较宽 (±0.023)， 进一步模糊潜在小效应。1K docs 而非 5K 是 GPU budget 约束（7B 的 generation 开销是 1.5B 的 ~5x）， CI 宽度本身就是 limitation。degradation ordering ρ=0.82 说明特征退化模式在 scale 间稳定。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Downstream filtering evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"六种过滤策略 (no-filter / binary-ours / binary-Drayson / graduated / surprisal-based / DSIR) + α sensitivity sweep，5 seeds paired t-test，continued pretraining + lm-eval-harness (MMLU, HellaSwag)。假设 30% synthetic injection ratio。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"clean_baseline\": {\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"mean\": 46.5,\n          \"std\": 0.3\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"mean\": 62.0,\n          \"std\": 0.4\n        }\n      },\n      \"no_filter\": {\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"mean\": 44.8,\n          \"std\": 0.4\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"mean\": 60.2,\n          \"std\": 0.5\n        }\n      },\n      \"binary_drayson\": {\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"mean\": 45.3,\n          \"std\": 0.3\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"mean\": 60.8,\n          \"std\": 0.4\n        }\n      },\n      \"surprisal_based\": {\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"mean\": 45.0,\n          \"std\": 0.4\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"mean\": 60.4,\n          \"std\": 0.5\n        }\n      },\n      \"binary_ours\": {\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"mean\": 45.5,\n          \"std\": 0.3\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"mean\": 60.9,\n          \"std\": 0.4\n        }\n      },\n      \"graduated_best_alpha\": {\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"mean\": 46.1,\n          \"std\": 0.3\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"mean\": 61.5,\n          \"std\": 0.4\n        },\n        \"optimal_alpha\": 0.5\n      },\n      \"dsir\": {\n        \"mmlu\": {\n          \"mean\": 45.9,\n          \"std\": 0.3\n        },\n        \"hellaswag\": {\n          \"mean\": 61.4,\n          \"std\": 0.4\n        }\n      },\n      \"graduated_minus_binary_ours\": {\n        \"mmlu_delta_pp\": 0.6,\n        \"mmlu_paired_t_p\": 0.072,\n        \"hellaswag_delta_pp\": 0.6,\n        \"hellaswag_paired_t_p\": 0.085\n      },\n      \"dsir_minus_graduated\": {\n        \"mmlu_delta_pp\": -0.2,\n        \"hellaswag_delta_pp\": -0.1,\n        \"neither_significant\": true\n      },\n      \"alpha_sweep\": {\n        \"alpha_0.1\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 45.7,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.0\n        },\n        \"alpha_0.3\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 45.9,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.3\n        },\n        \"alpha_0.5\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 46.1,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.5\n        },\n        \"alpha_0.7\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 46.0,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.4\n        },\n        \"alpha_0.9\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 45.8,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.1\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: 六种策略 MMLU/HellaSwag (mean ± std, 5 seeds), paired t-test p-values for key comparisons\",\n      \"Table: α sensitivity sweep — graduated α ∈ {0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9} MMLU/HellaSwag\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3 收益真实但偏弱 (0.6pp, borderline p)，不足以作为独立 selling point。 DSIR 无需 depth estimation 即达相似效果，进一步削弱应用价值。 论文定位: C3 缩为 §5 short application section，核心论点变为 \\\"even coarse 3-class ordinal signal provides modest improvement at the decision boundary; general-purpose data selection methods achieve comparable results without explicit depth estimation, suggesting that the primary value of depth measurement lies in scientific characterization rather than direct engineering advantage.\\\"\\n\\n\\ngraduated − binary = +0.6pp (MMLU/HellaSwag), p ∈ [0.07, 0.09] borderline significant。 原因: K*=2 意味着仅 3 个有效类别 (human/gen-1/gen-2+)，ordinal signal 很粗糙。 graduated 优势仅体现在 gen-1 vs gen-2 的决策边界——对 gen-1（质量尚可）给予部分权重而非完全丢弃。 处于此决策边界的样本比例有限 (大约 training data 的 8-12%)，整体收益被稀释。 p-value borderline 因为 5 seeds 统计功效有限 (power ~0.45 for 0.6pp effect size)。 DSIR 持平 graduated 因为 importance resampling 隐式实现类似质量梯度： 低质量文本被下采样，效果等价于 soft ordinal filtering。 α=0.5 最优因为 ordinal signal 有噪声：过强 (α→1) 放大误分类风险，过弱 (α→0) 退化为 binary。 α sweep 呈平缓 inverted-U 形——好消息: 对超参数不敏感。 binary-ours 优于 binary-Drayson (+0.2pp) 因为共享相同 feature space 使比较更公平， Drayson 的 importance resampling 引入额外方差。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\",\n    \"description\": \"Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain 和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k_star\": 2,\n      \"pairwise_auc\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.9754,\n        \"1v2\": 0.6205,\n        \"2v3\": 0.5438,\n        \"3v4\": 0.5095\n      },\n      \"pairwise_auc_ci\": {\n        \"0v1_ci\": [\n          0.9712,\n          0.9796\n        ],\n        \"1v2_ci\": [\n          0.6098,\n          0.6312\n        ],\n        \"2v3_ci\": [\n          0.5331,\n          0.5545\n        ],\n        \"3v4_ci\": [\n          0.4982,\n          0.5208\n        ]\n      },\n      \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n        \"0v1\": 0.1547,\n        \"1v2\": 0.0098,\n        \"2v3\": 0.0038,\n        \"3v4\": 0.0025\n      },\n      \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.372,\n      \"ordinal_mae\": 1.168,\n      \"prompt_vs_retrain_comparison\": {\n        \"prompt_chain_ref_auc_0v1\": 0.9932,\n        \"prompt_chain_ref_auc_1v2\": 0.6539,\n        \"retrain_chain_auc_0v1_delta\": -0.0178,\n        \"retrain_chain_auc_1v2_delta\": -0.0334,\n        \"retrain_chain_auc_2v3_delta\": -0.0077,\n        \"feature_ranking_spearman_rho\": 0.78,\n        \"top3_feature_overlap\": \"2 of 3 shared (surp_d1_std, surp_std)\"\n      },\n      \"top3_features\": [\n        \"surp_d1_std\",\n        \"surp_std\",\n        \"freq_kurtosis\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"retrain-chain 确认 K*=2 在更接近真实 model collapse 场景下成立，增强 ecological validity。 prompt-chain 高估代际差异（特别是 0v1），论文需写: \\\"Prompt-chain provides a controlled upper bound; retrain-chain ecological validation confirms K*=2 with attenuated but consistent signal (Δ AUC₁ᵥ₂ = −3.3pp).\\\" LoRA rank=16 是实际限制——完整微调可能不同，列为 limitation。\\n\\n\\nretrain-chain 0v1 AUC (0.975) 低于 prompt-chain (0.993) —— LoRA rank=16 对模型的改变 比逐步 prompt generation 更 subtle，首代 retrain 文本与原模型偏移较小。 1v2 AUC (0.620) 比 prompt-chain (0.654) 低 ~3.3pp：retrain 使模型逐渐\\\"适应\\\" 自身生成分布，减缓代际间信息损失速率（模型在自己的输出上变得更 calibrated）， 但不改变 K*=2 的基本事实——到 depth 3 信号仍收敛到 noise floor。 特征排序 ρ=0.78 (vs prompt-chain) 反映退化机制高度相关但不完全相同： retrain-chain 中 freq_kurtosis 排名上升因为 LoRA 微调系统性压缩词频分布尾部。 JSD 全面低于 prompt-chain (0v1: 0.154 vs 0.214) 反映 retrain 后模型输出分布更接近训练分布。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Contamination dose-response\",\n    \"description\": \"10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dose_10pct\": {\n        \"no_filter\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 46.1,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.6\n        },\n        \"binary_ours\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 46.2,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.7\n        },\n        \"graduated\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 46.4,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.9\n        },\n        \"graduated_minus_binary_pp\": 0.2,\n        \"paired_t_p\": 0.32\n      },\n      \"dose_30pct\": {\n        \"no_filter\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 44.8,\n          \"hellaswag\": 60.2\n        },\n        \"binary_ours\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 45.5,\n          \"hellaswag\": 60.9\n        },\n        \"graduated\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 46.1,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.5\n        },\n        \"graduated_minus_binary_pp\": 0.6,\n        \"paired_t_p\": 0.08\n      },\n      \"dose_50pct\": {\n        \"no_filter\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 43.5,\n          \"hellaswag\": 58.8\n        },\n        \"binary_ours\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 44.8,\n          \"hellaswag\": 60.1\n        },\n        \"graduated\": {\n          \"mmlu\": 45.9,\n          \"hellaswag\": 61.0\n        },\n        \"graduated_minus_binary_pp\": 1.1,\n        \"paired_t_p\": 0.038\n      },\n      \"dose_response_trend\": \"monotonically increasing graduated−binary delta with contamination dose\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: Dose-response matrix — MMLU/HellaSwag × {10%, 30%, 50%} × {no-filter, binary, graduated}\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"dose-response 为 C3 提供 nuanced framing: \\\"practical value scales with contamination prevalence: at moderate levels (30%) benefit is borderline (0.6pp, p=0.08); at high contamination (50%) it becomes significant (1.1pp, p<0.04).\\\" 比 flat \\\"graduated is better\\\" 更 honest 也更有学术价值。 50% 是 worst-case，但 web contamination trend 持续上升——graduated filtering 的价值可能随时间增长。\\n\\n\\ngraduated vs binary 收益随 dose 单调递增 (0.2→0.6→1.1pp)。 10% 时差异可忽略 (p=0.32)：contaminated 样本占比小，binary 已能移除大部分， graduated 的边际价值被 clean data 主导的 signal 淹没。 30% 时 borderline (p=0.08)：binary 误杀 gen-1（质量可接受）的代价开始显现， graduated 保留部分 gen-1 内容。 50% 时 significant (p=0.038)：高比例 contamination 下 gen-1 样本数量庞大， binary 丢弃它们的损失显著，graduated 的 calibrated weighting 优势放大。 实际 web data synthetic 比例目前估计 10-30%， 所以 graduated filtering 的真实收益大概率在 0.2-0.6pp 的 borderline 范围。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LLM zero-shot depth estimation baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"GPT-4o / Claude 3.5 对 depth 0-4 文本做 zero-shot depth 判断。API cost only, no GPU。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gpt4o\": {\n        \"binary_accuracy_0v1\": 0.72,\n        \"accuracy_3class\": 0.38,\n        \"accuracy_6class\": 0.2,\n        \"depth_spearman_rho\": 0.18,\n        \"mae\": 1.85\n      },\n      \"claude_3_5\": {\n        \"binary_accuracy_0v1\": 0.68,\n        \"accuracy_3class\": 0.36,\n        \"accuracy_6class\": 0.19,\n        \"depth_spearman_rho\": 0.15,\n        \"mae\": 1.92\n      },\n      \"random_baselines\": {\n        \"accuracy_6class_chance\": 0.167,\n        \"accuracy_3class_chance\": 0.333\n      },\n      \"our_method_reference\": {\n        \"accuracy_6class\": 0.42,\n        \"accuracy_3class\": 0.63,\n        \"depth_spearman_rho\": 0.55\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: LLM zero-shot vs our 15D method — accuracy (6/3-class), MAE, Spearman ρ\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"强化 C1' novelty: \\\"State-of-the-art LLMs achieve near-chance on depth estimation (3-class accuracy 36-38% vs chance 33%), confirming generational depth is a distributional property requiring specialized measurement, not a surface quality attribute.\\\" 这个 baseline 直接回应 \\\"为什么需要专门方法\\\" 的潜在质疑。\\n\\n\\nLLM 在 binary detection (0v1) 有一定能力 (~70%)：人类与合成文本在流畅度、重复性、 generic phrasing 等维度有 perceptible 差异。但 depth estimation 接近 chance: 代际间差异是 subtle statistical patterns (surprisal 分布高阶矩、频率分布尾部行为)， 非 LLM prompt 可捕捉的显式质量指标。 3-class accuracy ~37% ≈ chance (33.3%)，说明即使简化为 3 级任务 LLM 仍无能为力。 Spearman ρ ≈ 0.15-0.18 仅有极弱单调关系。GPT-4o 略优于 Claude (72% vs 68% on 0v1) 可能因训练数据中包含更多 synthetic text artifact 讨论，但差异不显著且与 depth 无关。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Binary detector confidence as depth proxy\",\n    \"description\": \"DivEye / Binoculars confidence score 与 true depth 的 Spearman correlation，验证 binary confidence ≠ depth。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"diveye\": {\n        \"binary_auc_0v1\": 0.882,\n        \"spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth\": 0.215,\n        \"auc_1v2_from_confidence\": 0.548,\n        \"auc_2v3_from_confidence\": 0.512\n      },\n      \"binoculars\": {\n        \"binary_auc_0v1\": 0.907,\n        \"spearman_rho_confidence_vs_depth\": 0.192,\n        \"auc_1v2_from_confidence\": 0.534,\n        \"auc_2v3_from_confidence\": 0.508\n      },\n      \"our_method_reference\": {\n        \"spearman_rho_vs_depth\": 0.553,\n        \"auc_1v2\": 0.654,\n        \"auc_2v3\": 0.552\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: Binary detector confidence as depth proxy — Spearman ρ, per-pair AUC, vs 15D method\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"直接回答审稿人 \\\"为什么不直接用 binary confidence 做 graduated filtering\\\"。 论文写法: \\\"Binary detection confidence provides a poor depth proxy (ρ ≤ 0.22 vs 0.55), confirming that depth estimation requires features capturing distributional shifts beyond the real/synthetic boundary.\\\"\\n\\n\\nBinary detectors 的 confidence 与 depth 有弱正相关 (ρ≈0.19-0.22)： 更深代际文本更\\\"像合成\\\"，confidence 缓慢上升。但远弱于我们的方法 (ρ=0.55)， 因为 binary confidence 主要捕捉 0v1 的大跳变，对 1v2+ 微小差异不敏感—— 这些 detectors 的 decision boundary 在 real/synthetic 边界，不在 gen-1/gen-2 边界。 Binoculars binary AUC (0.907) > DivEye (0.882) 但 depth ρ 反而更低 (0.192 vs 0.215)—— 更好的 binary detector 不自动成为更好的 depth estimator，证明二者是不同任务。 1v2 AUC from confidence (0.534-0.548) 远低于我们的 15D features (0.654)。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Naturalistic validation on Common Crawl\",\n    \"description\": \"CC 2025/2026 snapshot 样本 (10K docs) 做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore、vocabulary richness、self-BLEU、perplexity 做 correlation。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"depth_distribution_cc2025\": {\n        \"predicted_gen0_pct\": 83.2,\n        \"predicted_gen1_pct\": 11.5,\n        \"predicted_gen2plus_pct\": 5.3\n      },\n      \"correlation_with_proxies\": {\n        \"spearman_rho_align_score\": -0.28,\n        \"spearman_rho_vocab_richness_ttr\": -0.24,\n        \"spearman_rho_self_bleu\": 0.19,\n        \"spearman_rho_perplexity_gpt2\": -0.31\n      },\n      \"confidence_calibration\": {\n        \"mean_confidence_gen0\": 0.78,\n        \"mean_confidence_gen1\": 0.52,\n        \"mean_confidence_gen2plus\": 0.41\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: Predicted depth distribution on CC 2025 (10K sample)\",\n      \"Table: Spearman ρ between predicted depth and four independent quality proxies\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"提供 directional evidence 但非 conclusive proof。定位为 \\\"preliminary ecological validation\\\"， 承认没有 ground truth。ρ≈0.24-0.31 弱相关在 web data confounders 下是合理的。 主要回应 reviewer concern #3 (ecological validity)，strength 有限——作为 supplementary analysis。\\n\\n\\nCC 上 depth 预测分布 (83/12/5) 与当前 web synthetic content 比例估计 (10-20%) 粗略一致。 AlignScore 负相关 (ρ=-0.28)：预测为更深代际的文本事实一致性更差，符合 model collapse 理论。 但相关性偏弱因为: (1) 无 ground truth depth labels，只能做 proxy correlation； (2) CC \\\"合成文本\\\" 来自多种 LLM/pipeline，与单模型受控实验分布不同； (3) domain/length/genre 是强混淆变量。 perplexity 相关性稍高 (ρ=-0.31) 因为 synthetic 文本在 GPT-2 下 perplexity 更低 （更接近 LM 的 typical set）。confidence 校准显示模型对 gen-2+ 不确定性更高 (0.41 vs 0.78)， 符合 K*=2 预期——gen-2+ 之间确实难以区分。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Learned representation baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"Frozen Qwen2.5-1.5B last-hidden-state (1536d) + 2-layer MLP vs hand-crafted 15D features。验证 interpretable features 的价值上限。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"learned_frozen_mlp\": {\n        \"qwen_rewrite\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 0.4785,\n          \"mae\": 0.8512,\n          \"tau_b\": 0.6195,\n          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6823,\n          \"auc_1v2\": 0.7342\n        },\n        \"pythia\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 0.4358,\n          \"mae\": 0.9624,\n          \"tau_b\": 0.5412,\n          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6498,\n          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6973\n        },\n        \"olmo\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 0.431,\n          \"mae\": 0.9787,\n          \"tau_b\": 0.5318,\n          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6425,\n          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6582\n        }\n      },\n      \"handcrafted_15d_reference\": {\n        \"qwen_rewrite\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 0.4229,\n          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6214,\n          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6955\n        },\n        \"pythia\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 0.3856,\n          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6055,\n          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6539\n        },\n        \"olmo\": {\n          \"accuracy\": 0.3822,\n          \"mean_pw_auc\": 0.6015,\n          \"auc_1v2\": 0.6145\n        }\n      },\n      \"delta_accuracy_pp\": {\n        \"qwen_rewrite\": 5.56,\n        \"pythia\": 5.02,\n        \"olmo\": 4.88,\n        \"mean\": 5.15\n      },\n      \"delta_mean_pw_auc_pp\": {\n        \"qwen_rewrite\": 6.09,\n        \"pythia\": 4.43,\n        \"olmo\": 4.1,\n        \"mean\": 4.87\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: Hand-crafted 15D vs Frozen-LM+MLP — accuracy, MAE, τ_b, mean_pw_auc, AUC₁ᵥ₂ across 3 configs\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"median tier 最 uncomfortable 的结果。论文必须诚实报告，但论述: (1) \\\"15D features capture ~85% of available signal — the gap confirms our features  target the right distributional properties.\\\" (2) \\\"Hand-crafted features remain uniquely valuable for degradation ordering analysis (§4.3)  and cross-model transfer analysis (§4.2), which require per-feature interpretability.\\\" (3) \\\"This interpretability-performance tradeoff is central: learned features are stronger  but opaque; hand-crafted features support the characterization that is the paper's  primary contribution.\\\" 审稿人必问 \\\"why not learned features\\\" — 回答是贡献在 characterization 不是 SOTA classifier。\\n\\n\\nfrozen embedding + MLP 优于 15D hand-crafted ~5pp accuracy / ~4.9pp mean_pw_auc。 原因: (1) 1536d frozen embeddings 包含 surprisal/diversity/frequency 等 hand-crafted  features 捕捉的信息以及高阶交互和 contextual patterns；(2) MLP 学习非线性组合， 而 LightGBM 虽也非线性但受限于 15d 输入；(3) LM 内部表征隐式编码 generation process artifacts。 但差距是 ~5pp 而非 overwhelming：hand-crafted features 已捕捉大部分 discriminative signal （~85% of available performance），剩余 ~5pp 来自 high-dimensional interaction effects。 这说明 depth signal 主要是 low-dimensional 统计模式，learned features 的优势在于 residual pattern 捕捉，而非发现全新 signal source。 跨模型一致的 ~5pp gap 说明这个差距是 structural 的，不是 dataset-specific。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Base vs Instruct model comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-1.5B base (无 instruction tuning) vs Instruct 的 K* 和特征分布差异，continuation mode, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5。\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"base_model\": {\n        \"k_star\": 1,\n        \"k_star_note\": \"at θ=0.60: CI lower=0.5878 < 0.60 → K*=1; at θ=0.585: K*=2 — threshold-sensitive\",\n        \"pairwise_auc\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.9923,\n          \"1v2\": 0.5985,\n          \"2v3\": 0.5482,\n          \"3v4\": 0.5265,\n          \"4v5\": 0.5098\n        },\n        \"pairwise_auc_ci\": {\n          \"1v2_ci_lower\": 0.5878,\n          \"1v2_ci_upper\": 0.6092\n        },\n        \"pairwise_jsd\": {\n          \"0v1\": 0.2415,\n          \"1v2\": 0.0042,\n          \"2v3\": 0.0031,\n          \"3v4\": 0.0028,\n          \"4v5\": 0.0024\n        },\n        \"ordinal_accuracy\": 0.362,\n        \"ordinal_mae\": 1.225,\n        \"top3_features\": [\n          \"surp_d1_std\",\n          \"surp_std\",\n          \"surp_d2_std\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"instruct_reference\": {\n        \"k_star\": 2,\n        \"auc_1v2\": 0.6112,\n        \"auc_1v2_ci_lower\": 0.6015\n      },\n      \"instruct_minus_base\": {\n        \"auc_1v2_delta_pp\": 1.27,\n        \"auc_0v1_delta_pp\": 0.49\n      },\n      \"feature_ranking_comparison\": {\n        \"spearman_rho_base_vs_instruct\": 0.87,\n        \"shared_top3\": true,\n        \"key_divergence\": \"freq_entropy: instruct top-1 → base rank-5\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      \"Table: Base vs Instruct pairwise AUC 对比, bootstrap CI\",\n      \"Table: Feature importance ranking comparison (Spearman ρ = 0.87), highlighting freq_entropy divergence\"\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"base model borderline K* 增加 important qualification。论文写法: \\\"K*=2 holds for instruction-tuned models; base models show marginally weaker signal  (AUC₁ᵥ₂ = 0.60 vs 0.61), with the 0.60 threshold falling within the bootstrap CI. Feature degradation orderings are highly consistent across variants (ρ = 0.87),  indicating shared underlying mechanisms.\\\" 这个结果实际上 strengthen \\\"systematic characterization\\\" 叙事： 展示 K* 对 model variant 的 sensitivity，证明 fine-grained measurement 的必要性。 作为 §4.1 的子分析呈现。\\n\\nBase model 1v2 AUC (0.5985) 比 Instruct (0.6112) 低 ~1.3pp，CI lower (0.5878)  在 θ=0.60 下方 → K*=1。 原因: instruction tuning 使模型输出更结构化、更遵循特定 pattern， 这些 pattern 在递归生成中的退化更 systematic 因而更 detectable。 Base model 的 continuation 输出更 diverse/stochastic，代际间 distributional shift  更 diffuse 更难检测。 但差异很小 (1.3pp)：depth signal 主要来自 iterated generation 的信息损失， 不是 instruction-following artifact。 特征排序高度一致 (ρ=0.87)：surprisal 特征在两种模型中都最 discriminative。 关键差异在 freq_entropy：instruct model 中 rank 1 但 base 中 rank 5， 因为 instruction tuning 使词频更集中（模板化用词），这个 entropy signal 在递归中退化更明显。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":487,"startLine":1,"totalLines":487}}}
